# Per-inference posterior dumps written by every study's `run_study.py`: one directory
# of `record.json` + `arrays.npz` per inference, individually past the 500 kB pre-commit
# limit. They are regenerated by re-running a study; each study's `inference_ids.json`
# is the id-only map from a result to its dump.
